description: gpy debug
expression: help
---
Debugging tools

Usage: gpy debug <COMMAND>

Commands:
  prompt  Show timing breakdown for prompt rendering
  paths   Dump every path GPY resolves from the environment
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
